{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:5.10.160","page_type":"section"},"citation":"5.10.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.10.160","content_hash":"f5e631d0e436a61778fe0d8f7c191ceae7ee8d412acd635c091912f5f1346ad8","heading":"Private security firms, employees, agents and guards.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.10.160:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.10.160","text":"(a) The annual license fee for persons engaged in the private security business, and employees, agents or guards of private security firms, shall be as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule for the following:\n(1) | Employees, agents, and guards of private security firms:\n| (i) | First year application\n| (ii) | Annual renewal\n(2) | Private security firms:\n| (i) | First year application\n| (ii) | Annual renewal\n(3) | Temporary license\n(1)\nEmployees, agents, and guards of private security firms:\n(i)\nFirst year application\n(ii)\nAnnual renewal\n(2)\nPrivate security firms:\n(i)\nFirst year application\n(ii)\nAnnual renewal\n(3)\nTemporary license\n(b) Each applicant for a license under this section shall be individually responsible for license fees and shall pay such fees as a condition to license processing. Licenses shall expire 12 months from the initial date of application. (Ord. 20631 § 31, 1-13-26.)\nCross References: Merchant or private police license, TMC 5.90.100 et seq.","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"3e3085c1-62e8-5c44-89a0-932a017df154"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.10.160","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.10.160","content_hash":"38e183f4a855a374bfda12cf8e830edebcfe4193d9fc5604942052b9352ec9e9","heading":null,"ordinal":0